{"word":"colombia","ipa":"kəˈləmbiə","persianMeaning":"کلمبیا","englishDefinition":"a republic in northwestern South America with a coastline on the Pacific Ocean and the Caribbean Sea; achieved independence from Spain in 1821 under the leadership of Simon Bolivar; Spanish is the official language","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"Colombia is known for producing some of the world's finest coffee beans.","examplePersian":"کلمبیا یک کشور در نواحی شمال‌غربی آمریکای جنوبی است.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"Low","toeflRelevance":"Low","greRelevance":"Low","tags":["General","CEFR","offline","Openjam","needs-collocation"],"source":"Openjam + ECDICT + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"Openjam MIT; ECDICT MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":7663,"examPriority":0,"learningOrder":378}
