{"word":"spice","ipa":"spaɪs","persianMeaning":"ماده‌ای معطر گیاهی برای نگهداری مواد غذایی، ماده‌ی معطر و تند گیاهی برای طعم‌دهی غذا، جالب‌تر یا لذیذ‌تر کردن چیزی، افزودن ادویه یا گیاه معطر به غذا","englishDefinition":"aromatic substances of vegetable origin used as a preservative","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"Spice was one of the most valuable commodities in medieval trade history.","examplePersian":"نمک و فلفل از قدیمی‌ترین ادویه‌های نگهدارنده مواد غذایی هستند.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"Low","toeflRelevance":"Low","greRelevance":"Low","tags":["General","CEFR","offline","Openjam","needs-collocation","CEFR-J"],"source":"Openjam + ECDICT + EnglishToPersianDictionaries; CEFR-J 1.5","sourceLicense":"Openjam MIT; ECDICT MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0; CEFR-J commercial use with attribution","frequencyRank":7851,"examPriority":0,"learningOrder":472}
